    <briefdescription>
<para>Exception thrown when an ONNX operator version conversion fails. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Derives from <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput>. Raise this exception (typically via the <ref refid="ir__pb__converter_8h_1ad5d6032d694d5f4a81d81e0c5ce3caa8" kindref="member">fail_convert()</ref> macro) to signal that the requested version conversion is not supported or that the model is in an invalid state for conversion.</para>
